	measure 'Average Unemployment' = ```
		AVERAGEX(SUMMARIZE('public retail_eda', 'public retail_eda'[store], 'public retail_eda'[date]), CALCULATE(SELECTEDVALUE('public retail_eda'[unemployment])))
		```
